{"id":"3e7207510b515565","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-oracle-tm.md","title":"Oracle Turing Machine","display":"df-oracle-tm — Oracle Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-oracle-tm","aliases":["28-df-oracle-tm","Oracle Turing Machine"],"display":"df-oracle-tm — Oracle Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-ntm]]","[[28-df-configuration]]","[[28-df-configuration-transition]]","[[28-df-computation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-oracle-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-oracle-tm</span><span>Oracle Turing Machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-tm — Oracle Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span>，工作带数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_M\">\\(k_M\\)</span>，配置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\">\\(C=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O=(M,r,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}})\">\\(O=(M,r,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le r\\le k_M\">\\(1\\le r\\le k_M\\)</span> 是查询工作带编号，三个查询状态互异且属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\">\\(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 为预言机；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a>。</li>\n<li>查询带中从位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 起、到第一个非二进制符号之前的前缀作为查询串；有限支撑保证该串有限。以查询转移替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{query}}\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\)</span> 上的普通转移，有限计算前缀集在 Assertion 中由该一步关系定义；记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)\\)</span>；初始带和头位置沿用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下文引入确定型与非确定型预言机描述集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OTM},\\mathrm{ONTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{OTM},\\mathrm{ONTM}\\)</span>；每个候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的状态分量以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_M,q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\">\\(Q_M,q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\)</span> 表示。时间的上确界取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\">\\(C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^0_{M,x}\">\\(C^0_{M,x}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OTM}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(M,r,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}})\\mid M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land1\\le r\\le k_M\\land\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}\\subseteq Q_M\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\}\\land|\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}|=3\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ONTM}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(M,r,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}})\\mid M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\land1\\le r\\le k_M\\land\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}\\subseteq Q_M\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\}\\land|\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}|=3\\},\\\\\n\\ell_O(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N\\mid T_r(j)\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle T_r(0),\\ldots,T_r(\\ell_O(C)-1)\\rangle,\\\\\nC^{\\mathsf y}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle q_{\\mathrm{yes}},T,i\\rangle,\\qquad C^{\\mathsf n}\\coloneqq\\langle q_{\\mathrm{no}},T,i\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OTM}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(M,r,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}})\\mid M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land1\\le r\\le k_M\\land\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}\\subseteq Q_M\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\}\\land|\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}|=3\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ONTM}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(M,r,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}})\\mid M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\land1\\le r\\le k_M\\land\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}\\subseteq Q_M\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\}\\land|\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}|=3\\},\\\\\n\\ell_O(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N\\mid T_r(j)\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle T_r(0),\\ldots,T_r(\\ell_O(C)-1)\\rangle,\\\\\nC^{\\mathsf y}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle q_{\\mathrm{yes}},T,i\\rangle,\\qquad C^{\\mathsf n}\\coloneqq\\langle q_{\\mathrm{no}},T,i\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}(C,C&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(q\\ne q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{Step}_M(C,C&#39;))\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(q=q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)\\in B\\land C&#39;=C^{\\mathsf y})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(q=q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)\\notin B\\land C&#39;=C^{\\mathsf n}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\{\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)^{m+1}\\mid C_0=C^0_{M,x}\\land\\forall j&lt;m\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}(C_j,C_{j+1})\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sup\\{m\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)\\},\\\\\nL(O^B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)\\;\\exists T,i\\;C_m=\\langle q_{\\mathrm{acc}},T,i\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}(C,C&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(q\\ne q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{Step}_M(C,C&#39;))\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(q=q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)\\in B\\land C&#39;=C^{\\mathsf y})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(q=q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)\\notin B\\land C&#39;=C^{\\mathsf n}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\{\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)^{m+1}\\mid C_0=C^0_{M,x}\\land\\forall j&lt;m\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}(C_j,C_{j+1})\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sup\\{m\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)\\},\\\\\nL(O^B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)\\;\\exists T,i\\;C_m=\\langle q_{\\mathrm{acc}},T,i\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>查询回答算一步，准备查询仍按普通步骤计时；所有工作带内容和头位置在回答时保持不变。确定型和非确定型两种预言机接口在同一原子内给出，修复了旧原子只定义确定型却被 NP 预言机类调用的问题。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义3.4；印刷73页；PDF99页。查询三状态、单步回答及非确定变体已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntm","status":"resolved","id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"",