:false},{"tex":"C,C'\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)","display":false},{"tex":"C^0_{M,x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OTM}&\\coloneqq\\{(M,r,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}})\\mid M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land1\\le r\\le k_M\\land\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}\\subseteq Q_M\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\}\\land|\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}|=3\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ONTM}&\\coloneqq\\{(M,r,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}})\\mid M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\land1\\le r\\le k_M\\land\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}\\subseteq Q_M\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\}\\land|\\{q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}|=3\\},\\\\\n\\ell_O(C)&\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N\\mid T_r(j)\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)&\\coloneqq\\langle T_r(0),\\ldots,T_r(\\ell_O(C)-1)\\rangle,\\\\\nC^{\\mathsf y}&\\coloneqq\\langle q_{\\mathrm{yes}},T,i\\rangle,\\qquad C^{\\mathsf n}\\coloneqq\\langle q_{\\mathrm{no}},T,i\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}(C,C')\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(q\\ne q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{Step}_M(C,C'))\\\\\n&\\lor(q=q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)\\in B\\land C'=C^{\\mathsf y})\\\\\n&\\lor(q=q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)\\notin B\\land C'=C^{\\mathsf n}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\{\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)^{m+1}\\mid C_0=C^0_{M,x}\\land\\forall j<m\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}(C_j,C_{j+1})\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)&\\coloneqq\\sup\\{m\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)\\},\\\\\nL(O^B)&\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^B}(x)\\;\\exists T,i\\;C_m=\\langle q_{\\mathrm{acc}},T,i\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3760,"backlinks":[{"id":"a58fab71e26cf742","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OTM}$、$\\operatorname{Step}_{O^B}$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-tm]]；$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,u)$、$C^0_{M,u}$ 采用其配置及初态接口；工作带输出 $\\operatorname{out}$ 见 [[28-df-machine-resources]]。对 $O=(M,d,q_{\\mathrm q},q_{\\mathrm y},q_{\\mathrm n})\\in\\mathrm{OTM}$，$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})$；$d$ 为查询工作带。"},{"id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OTM}$、$\\mathrm{ONTM}$、$L(O^B)$、$\\operatorname{time}_{O^B}(x)$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-tm]]。"},{"id":"636845930cfd1ccc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；任务 $T\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathrm{OTM}$、$L(C^B)$、$\\operatorname{time}_{C^B}$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-tm]]。$C\\in\\mathrm{OTM}$，$m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$；$C$ 在输入 $\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)$ 上询问候选程序的接受语言 $B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$U_j$ 是 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀随机串；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"预言机：[[28-df-oracle-tm]]、[[28-df-oracle-class]]、[[28-df-turing-reduction]]、[[28-df-relativization]]、[[28-thm-baker-gill-solovay]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","e6357334ccd3589d","599727eea07e91d7","6b648ff230619ba2","256220eba4eba968"]}